---
// Telegram, done properly: tables, code blocks, expandable quotes — native.
---

<div
  class="tg-card tg"
  role="img"
  aria-label="A single Telegram reply from klanker showing native rich formatting: a status table of three services, a syntax-highlighted diff code block, and a collapsed expandable quote holding the full deploy log."
>
  <div class="tg-head" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="back">‹</span>
    <span class="who"><b>klanker</b><span>bot</span></span>
    <span class="tg-ava a4">k</span>
  </div>
  <div class="tg-body" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="msg out tail">
      <p>how did the deploy go?</p>
      <span class="meta">17:20 <span class="ticks">✓✓</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="msg in tail" style="max-width:94%">
      <span class="name">klanker</span>
      <p><b>Clean deploy, all three services healthy.</b></p>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>service</th><th>status</th><th>p95</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>api</td><td>✅ up</td><td>84ms</td></tr>
          <tr><td>web</td><td>✅ up</td><td>112ms</td></tr>
          <tr><td>worker</td><td>✅ up</td><td>—</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p>One config change shipped with it:</p>
      <pre><span class="k">- healthcheck_interval: 60s</span>
<span class="s">+ healthcheck_interval: 15s</span></pre>
      <div class="quote">
        <b>Full deploy log</b> — 214 lines · rollout 3m 41s end to end…
        <span class="expander">▼ expand</span>
      </div>
      <span class="meta">17:21</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
